<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Puzzle Challenge</title>
</head>
<body>

<header>

    <h1>🧩 Daily Puzzle Challenge</h1>

    <p>
        Test your observation and logical thinking.
    </p>

</header>

<hr>

<main>

<section>

    <h2>🔢 Puzzle 1</h2>

    <p>
        What number comes next?
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>2, 4, 6, 8, ?</strong>
    </p>

    <details>
        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
        <p>10</p>
    </details>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🔤 Puzzle 2</h2>

    <p>
        Which word does not belong?
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Apple</li>
        <li>Mango</li>
        <li>Carrot</li>
        <li>Banana</li>
    </ul>

    <details>
        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
        <p>Carrot — it is commonly classified as a vegetable.</p>
    </details>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🧠 Puzzle 3</h2>

    <p>
        I have keys but cannot open a door.
        What am I?
    </p>

    <details>
        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
        <p>A keyboard.</p>
    </details>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🏆 Challenge Score</h2>

    <label for="score">Your progress:</label>

    <progress
        id="score"
        value="70"
        max="100">
    </progress>

    <p>70%</p>

</section>

</main>

<footer>
    <hr>
    <p>Puzzle Challenge © 2026</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
